      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1.2 The 6-month bedaquiline, delamanid,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.65083312988281,
        482.59893798828125,
        105.53083038330078
      ],
      "text": "linezolid, levofloxacin and clofazimine (BDLLfxC) regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        117.23619842529297,
        236.23428344726562,
        131.59120178222656
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation (NEW)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        138.850830078125,
        495.4471740722656,
        153.40382385253906
      ],
      "text": "1.2 WHO suggests the use of a 6-month treatment regimen composed of bedaquiline,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        150.96083068847656,
        504.2615661621094,
        165.40382385253906
      ],
      "text": "delamanid, linezolid (600 mg), levofloxacin, and clofazimine (BDLLfxC) in MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        162.96083068847656,
        350.2570495605469,
        177.40382385253906
      ],
      "text": "patients with or without fluoroquinolone resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        177.9368438720703,
        389.42132568359375,
        193.60084533691406
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.33322143554688,
        119.47928619384766,
        226.18521118164062
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.39320373535156,
        524.5437622070312,
        247.83619689941406
      ],
      "text": "1.\t  Drug susceptibility testing (DST) for fluoroquinolones is strongly encouraged in people with MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        246.5930938720703,
        527.3484497070312,
        261.0361022949219
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB. Although it should not delay the initiation of the BDLLfxC, the test results should guide the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993748664855957,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        259.7930908203125,
        394.39093017578125,
        274.2361145019531
      ],
      "text": "decision on whether levofloxacin or clofazimine should be retained.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        277.2451171875,
        298.9967041015625,
        291.6881408691406
      ],
      "text": "2.\t This recommendation applies to the following:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        294.69708251953125,
        527.5748291015625,
        309.1401062011719
      ],
      "text": "a.\t  People with MDR/RR-TB or pre-XDR-TB (i.e. MDR/RR-TB and resistance to fluoroquinolones).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        312.14898681640625,
        527.1781616210938,
        326.5920104980469
      ],
      "text": "b.\t Patients with less than 1 month of previous exposure to bedaquiline, linezolid, delamanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        325.34912109375,
        527.3880004882812,
        339.7921447753906
      ],
      "text": "or clofazimine. When exposure is greater than 1 month, these patients may still receive the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        338.5491027832031,
        527.4093017578125,
        352.99212646484375
      ],
      "text": "regimen if resistance to the specific medicines involved in such exposure has been ruled out.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        356.0010070800781,
        527.4124755859375,
        370.44403076171875
      ],
      "text": "c.\t People with diagnosed pulmonary TB of all ages, including children, adolescents, PLHIV, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        369.2010192871094,
        271.392822265625,
        383.64404296875
      ],
      "text": "pregnant and breastfeeding women.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        386.65301513671875,
        527.389404296875,
        401.0960388183594
      ],
      "text": "d.\t People with all forms of extrapulmonary TB except for TB involving the CNS, osteoarticular",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        399.8529968261719,
        388.4747009277344,
        414.2960205078125
      ],
      "text": "TB, or disseminated forms of TB with multiorgan involvement.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        417.30499267578125,
        527.44091796875,
        431.7480163574219
      ],
      "text": "e.\t Children and adolescents who do not have bacteriological confirmation of TB or resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        430.5050048828125,
        527.54736328125,
        444.9480285644531
      ],
      "text": "patterns but who do have a high likelihood of MDR/RR-TB (based on clinical signs and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        443.70501708984375,
        524.408447265625,
        458.1480407714844
      ],
      "text": "symptoms of TB, in combination with a history of contact with a patient with confirmed MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        456.9049987792969,
        137.6031036376953,
        471.3480224609375
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.3569030761719,
        527.426025390625,
        488.7999267578125
      ],
      "text": "3.\t When resistance to fluoroquinolones is unknown, the regimen should be started as BDLLfxC and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        487.5569152832031,
        527.4227294921875,
        501.99993896484375
      ],
      "text": "then adjusted based on the DST results. In cases of quinolone susceptibility, clofazimine should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        500.75689697265625,
        527.1913452148438,
        515.1998901367188
      ],
      "text": "be dropped and the regimen started or continued as bedaquiline, delamanid, linezolid and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        513.9569091796875,
        527.386474609375,
        528.39990234375
      ],
      "text": "levofloxacin (BDLLfx). In cases of resistance to fluoroquinolones, levofloxacin should be dropped",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        527.1568603515625,
        527.2806396484375,
        541.599853515625
      ],
      "text": "and the regimen started or continued as bedaquiline, delamanid, linezolid and clofazimine (BDLC).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.967652320861816,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.9741821289062,
        128.1744842529297,
        570.8262329101562
      ],
      "text": "Rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.0341186523438,
        527.1273803710938,
        592.4771118164062
      ],
      "text": "The rationale for this recommendation is based on the evidence and considerations described in detail",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961984634399414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.234130859375,
        527.4036254882812,
        605.6771240234375
      ],
      "text": "in the following two subsections. Data from an RCT (BEAT Tuberculosis trial: NCT04062201) showed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.43408203125,
        527.4608764648438,
        618.8770751953125
      ],
      "text": "that the efficacy and safety of the BDLLfxC regimen was similar to that of the control arm regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        617.6340942382812,
        527.572998046875,
        632.0770874023438
      ],
      "text": "(WHO-recommended 9-month or longer regimens), and offers advantages based on its shorter",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        630.8341064453125,
        527.4058227539062,
        645.277099609375
      ],
      "text": "duration and lower pill burden than the comparators. It was judged that implementing this regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.0341186523438,
        527.4113159179688,
        658.4771118164062
      ],
      "text": "was probably feasible and acceptable, with equity probably improved, and that implementing this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.234130859375,
        527.4190063476562,
        671.6771240234375
      ],
      "text": "regimen was probably suitable for most population groups, including pregnant and breastfeeding",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.43408203125,
        198.39019775390625,
        684.8770751953125
      ],
      "text": "women, children and PLHIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.2512817382812,
        191.23452758789062,
        714.1033325195312
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.311279296875,
        527.172119140625,
        735.7542724609375
      ],
      "text": "This section provides the PICO question, the data and studies considered to answer the questions, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976274490356445,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.5112915039062,
        527.3914794921875,
        748.9542846679688
      ],
      "text": "methods used for analysis and data synthesis, a summary of evidence on desirable and undesirable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        747.711181640625,
        527.4432373046875,
        762.1541748046875
      ],
      "text": "effects and the certainty of that evidence, and a summary of other evidence considered during the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  73",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
